  "title": "Buy a product",
  "person": "customer",
  "description": "One buyer puts the Blue mug in the cart and pays: the product and checkout screens, the Cart, Catalog, Orders and Payments components, and the rows that change in orders and order_items.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "target": "b05d90b4-72c6-4463-bcf4-570c14739018",
